ort tactic  when they're lower on hp  and if you pick up the weapon off the  ground fast enough they'll wait for you  to toss it back at them take the day off  play some catch with your lasalfo son  [Music]  one secret that's much harder to spot is  in kakariko village's theme there's one  extremely subtle nod to the original  kakariko theme song hidden in the notes  you probably missed hajimewakai said  that the secret wasn't found by players  initially and he had to hint at us to  find it during an interview  [Music]  [Applause]  didn't hear it well here's some  background notes to help point them out  [Music]  it's the latter half of the beginning  part of the original kakariko theme song  using a glockenspiel  [Music]  what's more interesting though is this  is a second subtle nod to ocarina times  version where there's a glockage peel  used in that song as well  [Music]  what was your favorite thing you learned  this time let us know in the comments  below we also still have an ongoing  playlist with all the latest breath of  the wild content still coming so keep it  here on gamespot  [Music]  you

